# Handoff

When working on a handoff.md file:

- Use the handoff template from `../product-spec-kit/artifacts/templates/handoff-template.md`
- Every handoff must include: PLACEMENT.md, prototype location, key decisions, what's done vs not done
- Include "How to Run Locally" steps
- Link to the Jira epic
- If design-critique was run, include the score
